{"articleNo":"367519","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=367519&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] ◆KIT디자인스튜디오(공동실험실습관 101호) 이용 재개 및 공간 개편 안내◆","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.05.16","hit":"22520","attachments":[{"name":"KIT 디자인스튜디오 이용안내(수정).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=367519&attachNo=112378"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\"><font face=\"Noto\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><b>&nbsp;◆KIT 디자인스튜디오(공동실험실습관 101호) 이용 재개&nbsp; 및 공간 개편 안내◆</b></span></font><br></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\">기존에&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Noto; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">공동실험실습관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Noto; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">101</span><span style=\"font-family: Noto; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">호&nbsp;전체 공간을&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Noto; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">참, 든, 난, 큰 으로 나누어&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Noto; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">KIT </span><span style=\"font-family: Noto; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">디자인스튜디오로 이용하였으나</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Noto; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\">향후 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\">'<span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">SMART FACTORY TESTBED</span>' </span><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\">와 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221);\">'</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Noto; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 221);\">KIT&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221);\">디자인스튜디오</span>'로 분리하여 운영할 예정입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Noto; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 221);\">※KIT&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Noto; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221);\">디자인스튜디오는 1층의 3D프린터 공간과 2층(복층구조) 설계공간으로 2개 파트 운영</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\">현재 공간 개편&nbsp;및</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\">내부 시설 공사의 마무리 단계이며</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Noto; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: Noto; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Noto; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: Noto; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Noto; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">23</span><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">일(월)</span>부터 설계공간 이용 및 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\">3D</span><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\">프린터 사용이 가능하므로</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\">기존과 같이</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">원스톱서비스에서 사용 신청</span>하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\">.(신청 후 승인여부 반드시 확인)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\">일전에 공지한 바와 같이 개편 과정에서 이용 기자재의 종류가 변경되었음을 알려드리며&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;\">이용 가능 공간 및 기자재 등 상세 내용은 첨부파</span><span style=\"font-family: Noto; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">일을 참고하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Noto; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-size:14.0pt;\">관련 문의사항은</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-size:14.0pt;\">공학교육혁신센터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">(</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:14.0pt;\">054-478-7935)</span><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-size:14.0pt;\">로 연락주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content